<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan HUBCO up 2.29 pct, new plant on.</title>
<headline>Pakistan HUBCO up 2.29 pct, new plant on.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's private Hub Power Co Ltd rose 0.90 rupee, or 2.29 percent, to 40.15 on Wednesday as the project's fourth and last 323-megawatt generator began production, dealers said.</p>
<p>The unit is due to start full commercial production later this month.</p>
<p>Some 5.2 million Hubco shares changed hands in fresh buying at the Karachi Stock Exchange, one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
